{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Root cause confirmed on origin/main 82a91a89f1d, no LLM.\n\n- In-process: begin_gate_job(\"verify_completion\", T, variant=\"graph=None;source=attested\"), edit_ticket(T), begin_gate_job again -> is_new=False and the same job id, while show_ticket already returned the edited text.\n- Tool-level red (tests/unit/test_mcp_llm_dedup.py): verify_completion_start after an edit returned the same job id; sync verify_completion ran the gate once instead of twice. Both pass with the fix.\n- Raising read: the key-shape test makes current_material_fingerprint raise. On 82a91a89f1d the plan-review variant (3040's _plan_review_variant) lets it escape, which fails the tool call before the gate starts. The shared _material_key now degrades it to material=None for both variants.\n- Existing tests: test_two_concurrent_calls_invoke_the_gate_exactly_once[verify_completion] passes unchanged. test_verify_completion_start_preserves_graph_tristate_and_variant_key pinned the literal old variant; its start/sync parity and graph=None assertions are unchanged, and only the literal gained \";material=None\". File impact and plan updated for that; plan re-review running.\n\nSigning defect found while scoping this: daredevil-marginal-dodo (0521-7e68). The attached pre-edit run signs post-edit material, and a close reuses it. That defect is not fixed by this change."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792380381781426001,"uuid":"1830e009-c2a8-49af-8f1f-5ce6d0f2b10e"}